<% content_for :title,'排行榜' %><section class="opening"><div><h1>有的屎，注定会被反复提起</h1><p>看行为，看时间。群友自然搬运与机器人投放各有各的账。</p></div><span class="edition">统计窗口<br><%= AppConfig.leaderboard.period/86400 %> 天</span></section><nav class="browse-tabs"><% RankingsController::BOARDS.each do |key,label| %><%= link_to label,rankings_path(board:key),class:@board==key ? 'selected' : nil %><% end %></nav><div class="ranking-title"><h2><%= RankingsController::BOARDS[@board] %></h2><span class="small muted">更新于 <%= museum_time(@snapshot&.generated_at) %></span></div><% if @board=='bad' %><div class="privacy-note">这里只统计明确的 🥱 反馈。沉默没有投反对票。</div><% end %><div class="ranking-list"><% @rows.each_with_index do |(record,value),index| %><div class="ranking-row"><span class="ranking-number mono"><%= format('%02d',index+1) %></span><div><% if record.is_a?(ShitEntry) %><span class="mono small muted"><%= record.sid %></span><h2><%= link_to record.display_title,entry_path(record) %></h2><p><%= safe_group_name(record.first_group) %> · 自然出土 <%= record.natural_group_count %> 群 · 存活 <%= record.lifespan_days %> 天</p><% elsif record.is_a?(Group) %><h2><%= group_link(record) %></h2><p><%= museum_date(record.joined_at) %> 入网</p><% else %><h2><%= link_to record.display_name,transporter_path(record) %></h2><p><%= record.title %> · <%= record.candidate_count %> 份样本</p><% end %></div><b class="ranking-value mono"><%= @board=='bad' ? rate(value) : @board=='transporters' ? value.round(3) : value.to_i %><small><%= {'longevity'=>'天','cross_group'=>'群','fastest'=>'群','transporters'=>'信誉','bad'=>'明确负反馈率'}.fetch(@board,'次') %></small></b></div><% end %></div><%= empty_state('这一榜单暂时没有记录。') if @rows.empty? %>
